[1.241, "o", "### Kernel benchmark (NVIDIA A40, torch 2.8.0+cu128, CUDA 12.8; 36-layer cache, K and V; median of 100 runs, L2 flushed)\r\n\r\n| T | copy ceiling | metric | eager PyTorch | torch.compile (max-autotune) | v0 naive | v1 tiled | v2 fused |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| 512 | 545 GB/s, 139 us | compress | 4086 us (4%) | 335 us (54%) | 376 us (48%) | 177 us (103%) | 173 us (105%) |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| 512 | 545 GB/s, 139 us | decompress | 2404 us (8%) | 182 us (100%) | 198 us (92%) | 190 us (96%) | 190 us (96%) |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| 2048 | 558 GB/s, 541 us | compress | 16292 us (4%) | 1297 us (55%) | 1439 us (49%) | 665 us (107%) | 675 us (105%) |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| 2048 | 558 GB/s, 541 us | decompress | 9437 us (8%) | 711 us (100%) | 767 us (92%) | 740 us (96%) | 740 us (96%) |\r\n| 8192 | 559 GB/s, 2161 us | compress | 64821 us (4%) | 5104 us (56%) | 5753 us (49%) | 2630 us (108%) | 2725 us (104%) |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| 8192 | 559 GB/s, 2161 us | decompress | 37431 us (8%) | 2824 us (100%) | 3094 us (92%) | 2939 us (97%) | 2939 us (96%) |\r\n\r\nAt T=8192: compress v2 is 1.9x faster than torch.compile and 24x faster than eager; compression ratio 3.20x; v2 bit-exact vs reference: K=True, V=True\r\n"]
[2.003, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;34m$ grep -A5 '### Recompute vs KV4' docs/tables.md\u001b[0m\r\n"]
